(2. Vector Calculus & Field Theorems) Tj
/F2 10 Tf
0 -16 Td
(Gradient: grad\(f\) = [df/dx, df/dy, df/dz] points in the direction of greatest rate of increase.) Tj
0 -16 Td
(Divergence Theorem: Integral over boundary dV of \(F . n dS\) = Triple integral over V of div\(F\) dV.) Tj
0 -16 Td
(Stokes Theorem: Closed loop line integral of \(F . dr\) = Surface integral of \(curl\(F\) . n dS\).) Tj
0 -16 Td
(Conservative Fields: A field F is conservative if curl\(F\) = 0 and line integral is path independent.) Tj
